Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.38,0:00:04.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.38,0:00:06.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The problem appears to be unsolvable.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.38,0:00:06.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这问题显然解不了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.34,0:00:08.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe we could run some computer simulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.34,0:00:08.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也许我们可以运行一下电脑模拟
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.59,0:00:10.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There are many variables. It would take forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.59,0:00:10.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}变数很多 会搞太久
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.01,0:00:13.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We've gotta be missing something.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.01,0:00:13.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们一定是漏了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.39,0:00:14.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. Let's start again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.39,0:00:14.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 再来一次吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.81,0:00:18.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The movie is playing here at 7:20, here at 7:40...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.81,0:00:18.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}电影上映时间分别是 七点二十 七点四十
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.43,0:00:20.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...here at 8:10, and here at 8:45.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.43,0:00:20.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}八点十分和八点四十五分
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.31,0:00:23.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right. These theaters have to be eliminated.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.31,0:00:23.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 这些电影院要删掉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.90,0:00:27.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why? They're state of the art: digital projection, surround sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.90,0:00:27.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么？它们是最新的 有数字投影跟二十频环绕音响
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.53,0:00:30.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, but they have no Icee machines.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.53,0:00:30.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 但他们没有卖艾西冰
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.95,0:00:34.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Despite my aggressive letter-writing campaign, I might add.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.95,0:00:34.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}尽管我采取了积极的投书运动
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.83,0:00:37.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What about the multiplex here? The seats are terrific.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.83,0:00:37.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这个复合式电影院呢？ 它们的座位超赞的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.87,0:00:42.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They have Twizzlers instead of Red Vines. No lumbar support can compensate for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.87,0:00:42.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们卖麻花糖而非红绳糖 多棒的座位也弥补不来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.63,0:00:47.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's gonna take an hour to eat and I don't see a Sheldon-approved restaurant...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.63,0:00:47.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}吃饭至少要花一小时 谢尔顿核准的餐厅
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.50,0:00:49.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...proximate to a Sheldon-approved theater.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.50,0:00:49.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}都不靠近 谢尔顿核准的电影院
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.09,0:00:52.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-We could eat after the movie. -Unacceptable.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.09,0:00:52.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我们可以看完再吃 -不能接受
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.64,0:00:56.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The delay would result in tomorrow morning's bowel movement at work.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.64,0:00:56.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}延迟晚餐会导致 明天上班的时候排便
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.52,0:01:00.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hang on, hang on. There's a 7-Eleven here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.52,0:01:00.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等等 这里有家便利店
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.77,0:01:04.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We smuggle Slurpees, which are essentially Icees, in under our coats...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.77,0:01:04.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们用外套偷渡思乐冰进去 那跟艾西冰差不多
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.52,0:01:08.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...after having a pleasant meal either here, here or here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.52,0:01:08.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这样就能在这些地方 先吃一顿大餐了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.44,0:01:10.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.44,0:01:12.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我们怎么没想到呢 -等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.65,0:01:12.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I don't see how we missed that. SHELDON: Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.82,0:01:16.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}In what universe are Slurpees Icees?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.82,0:01:16.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在哪个世界里思乐冰是艾西冰了？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.74,0:01:19.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's how we missed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.74,0:01:19.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}难怪我们没想到
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.08,0:01:22.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Would you be prepared, on a non-precedential basis...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.08,0:01:22.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 你是否能以非判例基础
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.87,0:01:25.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...to create an emergency ad hoc Slurpee-Icee equivalency?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.87,0:01:25.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}制造出思乐冰 相当于艾西冰的非常状态？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.92,0:01:29.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, Leonard, you know I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.92,0:01:29.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德 你知道我不能那样做
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.55,0:01:32.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, I guess we only have one option.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.55,0:01:32.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那我们只有一个选择了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.80,0:01:34.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yup, I don't see any way around it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.80,0:01:34.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是啊 我也想不出别的办法
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.55,0:01:36.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Bye, Sheldon. -See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.55,0:01:36.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-再见 谢尔顿 -再见
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.80,0:01:38.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Later, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.80,0:01:38.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}再见
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.35,0:01:46.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They're right. It was the only option.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.35,0:01:46.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们说的对 这是唯一的选择
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.38,0:02:16.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Oh. Oh. Shut the door, Shut the door. -Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.38,0:02:16.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-关门、关门 -为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.51,0:02:18.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.51,0:02:18.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}关就是了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.35,0:02:25.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Get inside and shut the door. -Well, you didn't specify.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.35,0:02:25.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-进来再关门 -你没讲清楚啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.77,0:02:31.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Is Leonard around? -He went to the movies without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.77,0:02:31.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-莱纳德在吗？ -他丢下我去看电影了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.78,0:02:34.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It was the only option.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.78,0:02:34.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是唯一的选择
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.41,0:02:45.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry, I don't know understand which social situation this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.41,0:02:45.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉 我不明白这是什么社会情境
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.87,0:02:48.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Could you give me some guidance how to proceed?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.87,0:02:48.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你可以指点我如何进行吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.17,0:02:49.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[SIGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.17,0:02:49.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大楼管理员带人在楼下看房子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.38,0:02:51.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The building manager's showing an apartment downstairs...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.38,0:02:55.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我还没缴房租 -我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.80,0:02:55.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-...and I haven't paid my rent. -Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.51,0:02:57.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not comfortable harboring a fugitive...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.51,0:02:57.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮 我不确定我会想要窝藏
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.68,0:03:00.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...from the 2311 North Los Robles Corporation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.68,0:03:00.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一位2311北洛白栎公寓的逃犯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.97,0:03:03.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's no big deal. I'm just a little behind on my bills.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.97,0:03:03.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没什么 我只是手头有点紧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.68,0:03:06.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They cut back my hours at the restaurant and my car broke down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.68,0:03:06.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为餐厅删减我的工时 我的车又坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.77,0:03:08.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you recall...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.77,0:03:08.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你应该记得
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.15,0:03:11.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I pointed out the "check engine" light to you several months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.15,0:03:11.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}几个月前我就指出 〝检查引擎〞灯的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.36,0:03:16.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, the "check engine" light is fine. It's still blinking away.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.36,0:03:16.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 〝检查引擎〞灯没事 它还是闪呀闪的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.16,0:03:20.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's the stupid engine that stopped working.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.16,0:03:20.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是那个笨引擎不会动了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.78,0:03:23.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It cost me, like, $1200 to fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.78,0:03:23.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}花了我一千二才修好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.04,0:03:28.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, it occurs to me. You could solve all your problems by obtaining more money.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.04,0:03:28.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我突然想到 你只要有更多钱就能解决问题了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.96,0:03:34.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, it occurs to me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.96,0:03:34.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是啊 我也突然想到了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.51,0:03:37.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hang on a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.51,0:03:37.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.89,0:03:43.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[PENNY GASPS]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.18,0:03:48.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Here. Take some.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.18,0:03:48.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}来 拿点去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.27,0:03:50.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Pay me back when you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.27,0:03:50.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等你有钱再还我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.98,0:03:52.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wow, you got a lot of money in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.98,0:03:52.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哇 你那里钱真多
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.86,0:03:55.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's why it's guarded by snakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.86,0:03:55.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以才要蛇来当守卫啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.95,0:03:59.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Take some. -Don't be silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.95,0:03:59.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-拿点去吧 -别傻了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.86,0:04:01.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm never silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.86,0:04:01.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我从来都不傻
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.20,0:04:05.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Here. -No, I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.20,0:04:05.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-拿去 -不 我不能拿
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.41,0:04:07.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Don't you need money? -Well, yeah, but--
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.41,0:04:07.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你不是需要钱吗？ -是啊 但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.46,0:04:08.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is money I'm not using.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.46,0:04:08.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这些钱我没有要用
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.00,0:04:10.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But what if you need it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.00,0:04:10.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}万一你需要钱呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.33,0:04:14.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My expenses account for 46.9 percent of my after-tax income.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.33,0:04:14.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的零用金是 税后收入的百分之四十六点九
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.34,0:04:17.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The rest is divvied up between a small savings account...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.34,0:04:17.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}剩下的分存在好几个小型储蓄帐户
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.17,0:04:19.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...this deceptive container of peanut brittle...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.17,0:04:19.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}包括这个花生糖的 骗人容器
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.55,0:04:22.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and the hollowed-out buttocks of a superhero action figure...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.55,0:04:22.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还有一个超级英雄人偶 挖空的臀部
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.80,0:04:25.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...who shall remain nameless for his own protection.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.80,0:04:25.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不会提起该英雄之名 这样才能保护他
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.06,0:04:31.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Or her own protection.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.06,0:04:31.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或是保护她
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.15,0:04:36.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Take some. -Really? I mean, are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.15,0:04:36.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-拿点去吧 -真的？你确定？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.03,0:04:38.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I see no large upcoming expenditures.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.03,0:04:38.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想最近不会有大额支出
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.07,0:04:41.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Unless they develop technology to fuse my skeleton...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.07,0:04:41.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}除非他们研发出平价的新技术
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.70,0:04:44.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...with Adamantium like Wolverine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.70,0:04:44.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}用像金刚狼的艾德曼合金 来熔合我的骨头
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.49,0:04:47.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are they working on that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.49,0:04:47.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们有在研究吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.00,0:04:50.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I sincerely hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.00,0:04:50.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我衷心的希望有
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.58,0:04:55.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. Well, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.58,0:04:55.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.51,0:05:01.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.68,0:05:11.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.77,0:05:14.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ah, hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.61,0:05:19.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, God, no, I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.61,0:05:19.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天哪 我不能拿
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.03,0:05:23.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, Sheldon, honey, I don't want things to be weird between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.03,0:05:23.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 我不希望 我们之间怪怪的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.24,0:05:26.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Won't it also be weird if I have to say hello to you on my way to work...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.24,0:05:26.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你住在废冰箱盒里 用雨水洗头
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.99,0:05:30.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and you're living in a refrigerator box and washing your hair with rain water?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.99,0:05:30.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我还得在每天上班途中 跟你打招呼 就不怪了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.29,0:05:34.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll pay you back as soon as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.29,0:05:34.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我会尽快还你钱
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.25,0:05:35.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Of course you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.25,0:05:35.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那当然
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.21,0:05:38.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's impossible to pay me back sooner than you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.21,0:05:38.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你真没钱的时候也还不了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.63,0:05:43.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Assuming you've subscribed to a linear understanding of time and causality.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.63,0:05:43.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}假设你知道时间与因果的线性关系
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.14,0:05:47.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm regretting this already.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.14,0:05:47.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我已经开始后悔了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.23,0:05:53.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, I've given the matter some thought...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.23,0:05:53.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道吗 我有一个想法
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.10,0:05:58.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and I think I'd be willing to be a house pet to a race of super-intelligent aliens.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.10,0:05:58.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想我很乐意 当超高智慧外星人的宠物
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.74,0:06:02.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.74,0:06:02.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有意思
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.49,0:06:04.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ask me why.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.49,0:06:04.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}问我为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.16,0:06:06.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do I have to?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.16,0:06:06.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我一定要问吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.82,0:06:09.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Of course. That's how you move a conversation forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.82,0:06:09.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当然 这样才能 继续对话下去啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.50,0:06:11.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.50,0:06:11.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.83,0:06:14.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The learning opportunities would be abundant.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.83,0:06:14.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}学习机会会很丰富
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.33,0:06:15.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Additionally...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.33,0:06:15.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}另外
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.58,0:06:18.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I like having my belly scratched.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.58,0:06:18.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我喜欢人家搔我肚子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.42,0:06:22.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hey, Penny. How was work? -Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.42,0:06:22.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-佩妮 工作怎么样？ -很好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.51,0:06:26.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I hope I'm a waitress at the Cheesecake Factory for my whole life.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.51,0:06:26.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我希望一辈子都在芝乐坊当服务生
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.68,0:06:28.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Was that sarcasm?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.68,0:06:28.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是反讽吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.72,0:06:29.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.72,0:06:29.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.02,0:06:31.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Was that sarcasm?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.02,0:06:31.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是反讽吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.68,0:06:33.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.68,0:06:33.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.35,0:06:35.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Was that sarcasm? -Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.35,0:06:35.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-那是反讽吗？ -够了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.02,0:06:38.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Penny?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.02,0:06:38.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.52,0:06:40.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-You appear to have a package here. -Oh, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.52,0:06:40.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你好像有包裹喔 -谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.94,0:06:42.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It must be the beret I ordered.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.94,0:06:42.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一定是我订的贝雷帽
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.69,0:06:45.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A couple of months ago. It was back-ordered.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.69,0:06:45.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}几个月前买的 是待送订单
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.03,0:06:48.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Did you know the beret is an example...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.03,0:06:48.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你可知道贝雷帽是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.12,0:06:51.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...of a piece of women's fashion adapted from male military uniforms?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.12,0:06:51.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}改编自男性军装的 女性时装之一？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.87,0:06:55.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Another fascinating example is the epaulet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.87,0:06:55.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}另一个神奇的例子是肩饰
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.08,0:07:00.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's not lying. He does find that fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.08,0:07:00.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他没骗人 他真的觉得那很神奇
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.21,0:07:02.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, look, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.21,0:07:02.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好啦 随便
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.55,0:07:05.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's not like I'm running up and down the streets buying berets.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.55,0:07:05.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我又不是在街上 跑来跑去买贝雷帽
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.72,0:07:09.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I bought one a month ago when it was back-ordered. It finally arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.72,0:07:09.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是一个月前买的待送订单 终于寄来了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.14,0:07:10.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-All right? -All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.14,0:07:10.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-可以吗？ -可以啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.72,0:07:13.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God, would you just get off my case?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.72,0:07:13.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天哪 你少管闲事好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.27,0:07:18.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Weird. -Oh, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.27,0:07:18.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-真怪 -很好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.10,0:07:21.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That was an unusual interaction. I wasn't sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.10,0:07:21.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那的确是异常反应 我还不太确定
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.61,0:07:25.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-You guys have an argument? -No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.61,0:07:25.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你们吵架了？ -没有
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.57,0:07:28.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You clearly did something to aggravate her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.57,0:07:28.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你显然做了什么事激怒她
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.41,0:07:29.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}SHELDON: I'm at a loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.41,0:07:29.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我百思不解
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.95,0:07:34.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you like, you can review my daily log of social interactions...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.95,0:07:34.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你可以去浏览我的社交反应网志
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.08,0:07:37.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and see if there's a blunder I overlooked.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.08,0:07:37.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看我有没有漏掉什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.42,0:07:39.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.42,0:07:39.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}给你
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.71,0:07:42.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, you owe me another $2. The price of moo shu pork went up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.71,0:07:42.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你欠我两块钱 木须肉丝涨价了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.75,0:07:43.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[SIGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.75,0:07:47.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当个坏犹太人真是越来越难了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.96,0:07:47.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's getting tougher and tougher to be a bad Jew.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.93,0:07:51.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Here you go, Penny. Shrimp with lobster sauce.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.93,0:07:51.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}给你 佩妮 虾龙胡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.22,0:07:52.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thank you. What's my share?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.22,0:07:52.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢 莱纳德 我的多少钱？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.68,0:07:56.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Uh, don't worry about it. It's my treat. -No, really. How much?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.68,0:07:56.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-放心 我请客 -不行 多少钱？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.43,0:07:57.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's whatever. Ten, $11.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.43,0:07:57.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}都可以啦 十块、十一块
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.89,0:07:59.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, which is it? Ten or 11?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.89,0:07:59.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}到底是多少？十还是十一？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.77,0:08:01.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Fourteen-fifty. But it's no biggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.77,0:08:01.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}十四块半 真的没什么啦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.44,0:08:04.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You'll get the next one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.44,0:08:04.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}下次再让你请
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.53,0:08:06.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[BOTH LAUGH]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.28,0:08:08.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.28,0:08:08.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.74,0:08:12.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He was just wondering if he wore skintight jeans and a tank top...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.74,0:08:12.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他在想 如果他穿 紧身牛仔裤和细肩带小背心
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.45,0:08:15.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...if he'd get his shrimp lo mein for free.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.45,0:08:15.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他的虾仁捞面会不会免费
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.96,0:08:20.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What are you saying? That I'm using my body to get dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.96,0:08:20.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你什么意思？我靠身材骗晚餐吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.33,0:08:22.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That I'm some sort of Chinese food prostitute?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.33,0:08:22.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是中国菜妓女吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.38,0:08:27.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, Raj, what are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.38,0:08:27.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对啊 拉吉 你是什么意思啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.01,0:08:30.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Let me tell you something, I pay my own way in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.01,0:08:30.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我告诉你吧 我都是自己付钱的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.97,0:08:32.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't rely on anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.97,0:08:32.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不靠任何人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.81,0:08:41.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What was that about? -He has a nervous bladder...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.81,0:08:41.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-他搞什么？ -他只要一紧张
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.23,0:08:43.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...when he's stressed out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.23,0:08:43.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就会尿急
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.52,0:08:46.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Kind of like a puppy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.52,0:08:46.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有点像小狗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.49,0:08:51.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Here, Leonard. Ten, 11, uh, 12-- $14.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.49,0:08:51.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拿去 莱纳德 十…十四
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.66,0:08:54.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's 14.50, but it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.66,0:08:54.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是十四块半 但没关系啦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.12,0:08:57.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, good. Dinner's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.12,0:08:57.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 晚餐来了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.95,0:09:00.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, dinner's here. And I'm having takeout food.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.95,0:09:00.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 晚餐来了 我在吃外带食物
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.54,0:09:02.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Okay. -You're damn right it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.54,0:09:02.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-好 -当然好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.33,0:09:06.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I've been having leftovers for four days and I wanted something different. So sue me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.33,0:09:06.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我吃了餐厅四天剩菜 我要换点别的 告我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.76,0:09:11.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Forgive me, Penny, but that would be the very definition of a frivolous lawsuit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.76,0:09:11.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉 佩妮 但那正是无聊诉讼的定义
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.26,0:09:15.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I will pay you back as soon as I can. You just have to give me time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.26,0:09:15.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 我会尽快还你钱 但你要给我一点时间
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.60,0:09:18.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Oh, wait. You lent her money? -She needed money.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.60,0:09:18.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-等等 你借她钱？ -她需要钱啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.35,0:09:21.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You seem under pressure. Did I not lend you a sufficient amount?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.35,0:09:21.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你好像压力很大 我借你的钱够吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.81,0:09:23.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can give you more.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.81,0:09:23.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我可以借你更多
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.10,0:09:27.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, you know, you would just love that, wouldn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.10,0:09:27.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你就是爱这样 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.48,0:09:28.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.48,0:09:28.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.03,0:09:31.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You would just love to open up your little snake can...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.03,0:09:31.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你就是爱打开 你那个小蛇罐
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.03,0:09:35.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and throw some money at the girl who can't pay her bills.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.03,0:09:36.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拿钱去砸付不了帐单的女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.28,0:09:36.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[SIGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.53,0:09:38.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Where are you going? -Going home.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.53,0:09:38.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你去哪里？ -回家
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.24,0:09:41.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Where I won't be interrogated like a criminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.24,0:09:41.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}免得被当做犯人一样被审讯
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.04,0:09:48.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I forgot my fortune cookie.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.04,0:09:48.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我忘了拿我的幸运饼干
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.47,0:09:54.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}In case either of you have larceny in your heart...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.47,0:09:54.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}以防万一 若你们有心犯下窃盗罪
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.97,0:09:58.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...you should know that I've moved my money out of the snake can.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.97,0:09:58.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们应该知道 我已经把蛇罐里的钱拿走了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.39,0:10:05.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But if you're ever short, there's always a couple of 50s in Green Lantern's ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.39,0:10:05.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但如果你缺钱 绿灯侠屁股里总有几张五十元钞票
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.03,0:10:13.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[KNOCKING ON DOOR]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.95,0:10:16.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hey. -Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.95,0:10:16.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-嘿 -嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.99,0:10:19.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A little mood lighting, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.99,0:10:19.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在用情调照明啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.20,0:10:22.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah. When I didn't pay my bill, the Department of Water and Power...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.20,0:10:22.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是啊 我没付帐单时 自来水公司和电力公司
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.58,0:10:25.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...thought I would enjoy the ambience.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.58,0:10:25.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就认为我喜欢营造气氛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.04,0:10:29.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, they're very considerate that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.04,0:10:29.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是哦 他们在那方面还真体贴
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.13,0:10:33.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I used Sheldon's money to pay my rent. Then I had, like, $14 left over.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.13,0:10:33.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我用谢尔顿的钱付房租 然后就只剩下十四元
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.51,0:10:37.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Fourteen dollars, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.51,0:10:37.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}十四元？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.30,0:10:40.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Put it back in your pocket or I'll find another place to put it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.30,0:10:40.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}放回你的口袋 不然我就放别处去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.77,0:10:44.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Back in the pocket it goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.77,0:10:44.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}放回口袋了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.56,0:10:48.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, you do understand that Sheldon doesn't care when he gets the money back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.56,0:10:48.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道谢尔顿真的不介意 你什么时候还钱
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.36,0:10:50.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's actually one of the few idiosyncrasies...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.36,0:10:50.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是他少有的特质之一
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.69,0:10:53.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...that doesn't make you wanna, you know, kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.69,0:10:53.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}让你不会想要杀了他
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.15,0:10:56.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, well, that's not really my big problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.15,0:10:56.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是啊 但那并不是我最大的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.74,0:11:00.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're a little behind on your bills. Everybody gets behind on bills.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.74,0:11:00.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你只是稍微迟缴帐单 大家都会这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.16,0:11:02.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, I know, it's just-- This wasn't the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.16,0:11:02.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道 只是…这不是原本的计划
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.74,0:11:04.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It wasn't supposed to go this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.74,0:11:04.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不应该是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.50,0:11:06.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, well, what was the plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.50,0:11:06.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}原本的计划是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.92,0:11:10.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Um, waitress for six months and then become a movie star.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.92,0:11:10.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当六个月的服务生 然后变成电影明星
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.00,0:11:13.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.38,0:11:14.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Was there a Plan B?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.38,0:11:14.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有没有B计划？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.72,0:11:16.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}TV star.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.72,0:11:16.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}电视明星
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.26,0:11:21.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, it's probably not as bad as you think. Let's take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.26,0:11:21.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可能没你想的那么糟 我们来看一下
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.31,0:11:23.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe we can find some corners to cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.31,0:11:23.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也许我们可以 找到省钱的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.93,0:11:25.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, here's something.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.93,0:11:25.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.44,0:11:29.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you don't have electricity, then you probably don't need cable.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.44,0:11:29.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你家没有电 大概就不需要有线电视了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.40,0:11:33.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just a suggestion.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.40,0:11:33.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只是个建议
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.15,0:11:37.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A hundred and seventy dollars for acting classes?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.15,0:11:37.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一百七十元上表演课？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.70,0:11:41.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, no, I can't give up my acting classes. I'm a professional actress.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.70,0:11:42.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 我不能放弃表演课 我是专业的女演员
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.08,0:11:42.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.28,0:11:44.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You had an acting job where you got paid?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.28,0:11:44.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你有演员工作能让你赚钱吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.08,0:11:45.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[SCOFFS]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.08,0:11:47.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那不是专业的定义
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.29,0:11:47.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That is not the definition of professional.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.25,0:11:53.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Actually, it kind of is. Let's keep looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.25,0:11:53.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}其实是的 我们继续找吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.05,0:11:57.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.47,0:12:01.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What's $1800 to the Los Angeles County Superior Court?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.47,0:12:01.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一千八百元付给 洛杉矶郡最高法院？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.26,0:12:03.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, that's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.26,0:12:03.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.10,0:12:04.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.10,0:12:04.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.31,0:12:09.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It sounds like you got caught speeding going 4000 miles an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.31,0:12:09.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听起来你像是被抓到超速6000公里
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.81,0:12:11.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, remember Kurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.81,0:12:11.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还记得库尔特吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.31,0:12:13.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Your ex-boyfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.31,0:12:13.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的前男友？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.61,0:12:16.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, he got arrested for taking a whiz on a cop car.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.61,0:12:16.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他因为尿在警车上遭到逮捕
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.07,0:12:18.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What? -He was drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.07,0:12:18.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-什么？ -他喝醉了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.82,0:12:21.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I would hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.82,0:12:21.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}最好是
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.16,0:12:24.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He had a bunch of outstanding tickets and a bench warrant, so I--
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.16,0:12:24.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他有一堆罚单 还有一张拘票 所以我…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.87,0:12:26.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, I paid his fines.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.87,0:12:26.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我帮他付了罚款
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.62,0:12:27.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Did he pay you back?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.62,0:12:27.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他有还你吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.83,0:12:29.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, but he will.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.83,0:12:29.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有 但他会还的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.50,0:12:32.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And that's based on the inherent credit-worthiness...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.50,0:12:32.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是根据天生不讲信用
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.58,0:12:36.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...of people who get drunk and urinate on police vehicles?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.58,0:12:36.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}喝醉还尿在警车上的人说的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.46,0:12:39.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leonard, I'm not gonna call up Kurt and ask him for money.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.46,0:12:40.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德 我不会打给库尔特 要他还钱的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.84,0:12:41.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.47,0:12:42.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.47,0:12:42.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你打算怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.84,0:12:46.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know but I might have to find a cheaper place to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.84,0:12:46.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不知道 但我可能得找更便宜的地方住
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.18,0:12:48.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.18,0:12:48.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哦 不
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.35,0:12:51.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, you don't wanna do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.35,0:12:51.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 你不会想那样做
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.65,0:12:52.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.65,0:12:52.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.86,0:12:55.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh, moving is a big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.86,0:12:55.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}搬家是大事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.52,0:12:59.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh, you-- You have to go to the supermarket and get boxes...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.52,0:12:59.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你得去超市拿纸箱
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.99,0:13:03.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and if they're not clean then your books smell like melons and it's--
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.99,0:13:03.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果箱子不干净 你的书就会有哈密瓜味…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.20,0:13:07.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why don't you just get a roommate and stay here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.20,0:13:07.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你何不找个室友 留在这里？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.70,0:13:09.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, do you know anybody?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.70,0:13:09.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你有认识的人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.16,0:13:13.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, I'm sure the guy living with Sheldon wouldn't mind moving in with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.16,0:13:13.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我相信跟谢尔顿住的人 不会介意搬来跟你住
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.63,0:13:18.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, Leonard, honey, if we started living together...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.63,0:13:18.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德 亲爱的 如果我们开始同居
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.88,0:13:21.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I wouldn't be able to keep my hands off you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.88,0:13:21.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我就会整天黏在你身上了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.22,0:13:25.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.22,0:13:25.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.22,0:13:30.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And you thought my acting lessons were a waste of money.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.22,0:13:30.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你还觉得我的表演课是浪费钱
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.40,0:13:39.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ugh. This moo shu pork's burning a hole through my duodenum.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.40,0:13:39.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这个木须肉丝让我的十二指肠穿孔了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.44,0:13:43.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Tsk, tsk. Leviticus 11:3.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.44,0:13:43.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}《利未记》第十一章第三节
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.36,0:13:48.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That which parteth the hoof and cheweth the cud among the beasts shall ye eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.36,0:13:48.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}凡蹄分两瓣、倒嚼的走兽 你们都可以吃
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.41,0:13:55.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, do I mock you with the Bhagavad Gita every time you scarf down a Whopper?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.41,0:13:55.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你每次狂吃华堡的时候 我会用薄伽梵歌挖苦你吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.80,0:14:03.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hey, what's going on? -We're on a quest to the Valley of Fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.80,0:14:03.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-怎么了？ -我们正在做去火之谷取圣冠的任务
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.84,0:14:06.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You want the Valley of Fire? It's right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.84,0:14:06.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你要去火之谷？就在这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.51,0:14:10.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, you guys wanna go on a real live quest?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.51,0:14:10.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们想要执行真正的任务吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.68,0:14:13.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Outside? I just made cocoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.68,0:14:13.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}去外面？我刚泡好热巧克力
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.27,0:14:15.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, come on, it'll be fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.27,0:14:15.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}走吧 很好玩的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.73,0:14:17.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.73,0:14:17.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么任务？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.27,0:14:19.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you guys remember Penny's ex-boyfriend Kurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.27,0:14:19.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们记得佩妮的前男友库尔特吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.90,0:14:24.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, that's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.90,0:14:24.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 就是他
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.11,0:14:28.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh, it turns out he owes Penny a lot of money and I'm gonna go get it from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.11,0:14:28.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}结果他欠了佩妮一大笔钱 我要去跟他讨债
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.78,0:14:30.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Who's with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.78,0:14:30.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谁要跟我去？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.21,0:14:36.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ooh, double sixes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.21,0:14:36.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}两个六点
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.21,0:14:38.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Really? You're just gonna let me go by myself?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.21,0:14:38.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的？你们要让我一个人去？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.88,0:14:41.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, cool, I got a sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.88,0:14:41.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}酷 我拿到一把剑
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.46,0:14:43.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I could use some help.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.46,0:14:43.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我可能需要帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.38,0:14:44.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.38,0:14:44.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}给你
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.59,0:14:48.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You guys are unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.59,0:14:48.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们真是不可理喻
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.18,0:14:51.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You play a game to simulate adventure, but when there's adventure...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.18,0:14:51.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们玩虚拟冒险游戏 可是在真实世界…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.52,0:14:53.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...in the real world you just wimp out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.52,0:14:53.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可以冒险的时候 你们却胆怯不前
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.81,0:14:56.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leonard, do you not recall the last time we visited this gentleman?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.81,0:14:56.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德 你不记得 上次我们拜访那个人的事了？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.06,0:14:59.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We returned home without pants.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.06,0:14:59.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们没穿裤子的跑回家
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.28,0:15:03.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I do. -Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.28,0:15:03.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我记得 -你确定？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.32,0:15:05.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because your proposal suggests that you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.32,0:15:05.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为你的提案显示你不记得了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.95,0:15:07.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not afraid of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.95,0:15:07.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不怕他
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.24,0:15:09.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right. Leonard fairly calls the question:
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.24,0:15:09.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 莱纳德 显然提出了问题
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.83,0:15:12.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Who is in favor of abandoning our game...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.83,0:15:12.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谁愿意放弃我们的游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.16,0:15:15.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and confronting Penny's steroid-infused ex-boyfriend...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.16,0:15:15.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}去对抗佩妮那个打类固醇的前男友
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.16,0:15:18.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...in a suicidal mission to extract money from him?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.16,0:15:18.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}进行向他讨债的自杀任务？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.75,0:15:23.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Say hi to Kurt for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.75,0:15:23.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}替我们问候库尔特
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.51,0:15:25.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.51,0:15:25.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.76,0:15:28.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When Frodo left the Shire to take the one ring to Mordor...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.76,0:15:28.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当佛罗多离开夏尔 带着魔戒去魔多的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.64,0:15:30.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...didn't Samwise, Pippin and Merry go?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.64,0:15:30.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}山姆、皮聘和梅利不也跟去了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.76,0:15:32.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-They did. -Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.76,0:15:32.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-没错 -所以呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.14,0:15:34.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They had a terrible time of it, Leonard.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.14,0:15:34.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}结果九死一生 莱纳德
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.27,0:15:38.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Plus, no one stole their pants.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.27,0:15:38.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而且没人偷他们的裤子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.73,0:15:40.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.73,0:15:40.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.98,0:15:44.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Enjoy your little game. I'll make this quest on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.98,0:15:44.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们慢慢玩 我自己去执行任务
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.53,0:15:45.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leonard, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.53,0:15:45.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.86,0:15:48.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Take a jacket, it's shpritzing a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.86,0:15:48.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}带件外套比较保险
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.62,0:15:51.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You guys suck.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.62,0:15:51.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们真烂
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.54,0:15:56.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on, please. He's so big.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.54,0:15:56.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拜托嘛 他那么强壮
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.54,0:16:03.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Okay, is everyone clear on the plan? -Yes. Koothrappali's going to wet himself...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.54,0:16:03.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-好 大家都清楚计划吗？ -清楚 库萨帕里会尿裤子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.50,0:16:07.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I'm gonna throw up, Sheldon's gonna run away, and you're going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.50,0:16:07.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我会吐 谢尔顿会落跑 你会挂掉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.88,0:16:11.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Shall we synchronize our watches?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.88,0:16:11.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们来对一下表吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.34,0:16:13.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Guys, there are four of us and one of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.34,0:16:13.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}各位 我们是四个对他一个
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.97,0:16:16.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Which means his triumph will be even larger.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.97,0:16:16.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}意即他的胜利更显威风
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.89,0:16:20.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Minstrels will write songs about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.89,0:16:20.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}吟游歌手会为他写歌
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.69,0:16:24.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, how about this? I'll do the talking, you stand behind me and try to look...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.69,0:16:24.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这样吧 我负责交谈 你们站在后面表现出…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.57,0:16:25.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...formidable.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.57,0:16:25.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}吓人的模样
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.57,0:16:33.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I should've peed before we left.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.57,0:16:33.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我出门前应该先尿尿的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.62,0:16:36.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.62,0:16:36.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎样？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.42,0:16:42.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hi, Kurt. -Lenny, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.42,0:16:42.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-嗨 库尔特 -小尼 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.13,0:16:46.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't really go by Lenny, but that's okay. Um....
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.13,0:16:46.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不喜欢被叫小尼 但无所谓啦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.51,0:16:49.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You remember Sheldon, Howard and Raj.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.51,0:16:49.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你还记得谢尔顿 霍华德和拉吉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.76,0:16:51.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.76,0:16:51.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不记得
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.72,0:16:53.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What do you want? -You don't remember me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.72,0:16:53.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-有什么事？ -你不记得我了？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.01,0:16:56.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-How could he not remember? -Sheldon, not now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.01,0:16:56.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-他怎么会不记得呢？ -谢尔顿 别吵
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.35,0:16:58.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I remember him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.35,0:16:58.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我记得他
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.77,0:17:01.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, here it is. Penny's in kind of a financial jam...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.77,0:17:01.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是这样的 佩妮遇上财务困难
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.73,0:17:05.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and the money you owe her would go a long way to solving her problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.73,0:17:05.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你欠她的钱 足以解决她的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.27,0:17:09.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-And she sent you to get it from me? -No, she's too proud to ask for the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.27,0:17:09.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-她派你来讨债？ -不 她太要面子不肯讨债
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.78,0:17:12.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I, on the other hand, feel you should honor your debt.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.78,0:17:12.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}相反地 我认为你应该要还债
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.78,0:17:14.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.78,0:17:14.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.79,0:17:20.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"Feel" is kind of a-- It's a strong word. Uh....
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.79,0:17:20.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}〝认为〞两字有点言重了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.54,0:17:23.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But I just-- I think it'd be a nice gesture on your part.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.54,0:17:23.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只是…觉得你可以表现善意
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.38,0:17:25.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She'll get it when she gets it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.38,0:17:25.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}时候到了我自然会还她
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.55,0:17:32.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, there you go. Problem solved.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.55,0:17:32.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好啦 问题解决了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.26,0:17:37.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A successful quest. Now let's find a gas station with a clean bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.26,0:17:37.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}任务成功 我们现在去 找间有干净厕所的加油站吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.81,0:17:39.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, the problem isn't solved.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.81,0:17:39.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 问题没有解决
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.98,0:17:41.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He just blew us off.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.98,0:17:41.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他只是把我们赶走了而已
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.23,0:17:43.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I've got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.23,0:17:43.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.31,0:17:47.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He didn't remember me, because the last time we met I was in a Halloween costume.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.31,0:17:47.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他不记得我是因为 上次我穿着万圣节戏服
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.28,0:17:52.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Come on, Leonard, let's go. -No. You can leave if you want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.28,0:17:52.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-莱纳德 走吧 -不 你们要走就走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.32,0:17:55.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I'm gonna see this through. -Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.32,0:17:55.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我要搞定这件事 -好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.04,0:18:03.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I guess technically that was my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.04,0:18:03.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}严格来说 这是我的错
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.84,0:18:11.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not leaving here without Penny's money.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.84,0:18:11.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没要到佩妮的钱 我是不会离开的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.34,0:18:15.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What happened to your backup?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.34,0:18:15.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的后援呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.30,0:18:18.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't need backup.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.30,0:18:18.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不需要后援
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.39,0:18:19.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I have right on my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.39,0:18:19.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}正义在我这方
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.85,0:18:28.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And I'm wearing cargo shorts under my pants.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.85,0:18:28.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而且我在长裤下面 有穿工作短裤
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.53,0:18:32.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.53,0:18:32.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}恭喜
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.19,0:18:34.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You may not have succeeded in getting cash...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.19,0:18:34.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你或许没有成功拿到钱
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.45,0:18:37.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but you did secure a formal acknowledgment of the debt.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.45,0:18:37.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}却确认了债务的正式回条
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.28,0:18:40.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（我欠佩妮）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.37,0:18:42.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（一千八百元 库尔特）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.79,0:18:46.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe we should have your head notarized.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.79,0:18:46.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也许我们应该 拿你的头去做公证
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.67,0:18:51.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If anybody cares, I still have to pee.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.67,0:18:51.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有任何人在乎的话 我还是想尿尿
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.84,0:18:58.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.84,0:18:58.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.89,0:19:01.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Is Sheldon here? -Yeah, hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.89,0:19:01.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-谢尔顿在吗？ -在 稍等
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.72,0:19:02.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.72,0:19:02.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.97,0:19:04.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Nice hat. -You know?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.97,0:19:04.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-帽子不错看 -你知道吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.85,0:19:07.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's kind of a fashionable look these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.85,0:19:07.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}最近很流行这样戴
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.15,0:19:11.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe if you're working on a tuna boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.15,0:19:11.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你是在 捕鲔鱼船上工作的话
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.61,0:19:13.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hello, Penny. -Sheldon, here is your money.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.61,0:19:13.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你好 佩妮 -谢尔顿 这是你的钱
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.15,0:19:16.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thank you very much, it helped a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.15,0:19:16.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真是谢谢你 它帮了我大忙
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.70,0:19:18.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sarcasm?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.70,0:19:18.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是反讽吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.28,0:19:20.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-No. -Darn.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.28,0:19:20.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-不是 -天哪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.66,0:19:23.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't seem to get the hang of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.66,0:19:23.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我好像怎么都学不会
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.00,0:19:27.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, I know it's none of my business, but where did the money come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.00,0:19:27.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道这不关我的事 但那笔钱是哪来的？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.75,0:19:29.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, I cut back my expenses like you said...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.75,0:19:29.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我照你说的减少支出
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.00,0:19:32.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and picked up more hours at the restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.00,0:19:32.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}增加在餐厅的工时
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.30,0:19:34.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The biggest thing was, out of the blue, Kurt shows up...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.30,0:19:34.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}最关键的是 库尔特突然出现
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.13,0:19:37.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and gives me the money he owes me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.13,0:19:37.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}把他欠我的钱还给我了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.01,0:19:38.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[PENNY CHUCKLES]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.01,0:19:39.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.22,0:19:39.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.43,0:19:41.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Did he say why?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.43,0:19:41.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他有说原因吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.85,0:19:45.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes. He said he was feeling guilty and wanted to do what was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.85,0:19:45.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有 他说很内疚 他想做对的事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.19,0:19:48.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[PENNY CHUCKLES]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.06,0:19:50.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.06,0:19:50.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就这样？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.11,0:19:57.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Did he give any reason as to why he came to this moral epiphany?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.11,0:19:57.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他有说出任何理由 为何突然良心发现？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.53,0:20:00.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Nope. I just think he's really changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.53,0:20:00.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有 我想他真的变了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.16,0:20:06.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're having dinner tomorrow night. And I get to wear my new beret. Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.16,0:20:06.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们明晚要吃饭 我要戴新的贝雷帽
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.21,0:20:09.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Bye, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.21,0:20:09.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}各位再见
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.21,0:20:10.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.21,0:20:10.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}再见
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.96,0:20:17.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well done, Leonard.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.96,0:20:17.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}干的好 莱纳德
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.97,0:20:21.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The true hero doesn't seek adulation.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.97,0:20:21.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真正的英雄是不求感谢的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.39,0:20:25.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He fights for right and justice simply because it's his nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.39,0:20:25.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他只为公道与正义而战 因为那是他的天性
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.52,0:20:27.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Penny's hooking up with her jerk of an ex-boyfriend...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.52,0:20:27.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮要跟她那个混蛋前男友复合
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.14,0:20:31.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and I have indelible ink on my forehead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.14,0:20:31.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的额头却留下洗不掉的墨水
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.56,0:20:35.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's your badge of honor. They're your, uh, warrior's wound, if you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.56,0:20:35.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是荣誉勋章 可以说是你的战疤
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.73,0:20:37.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.73,0:20:37.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我错了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.40,0:20:40.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Minstrels will write songs about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.40,0:20:40.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}吟游歌手会为你写歌
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.32,0:20:43.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.32,0:20:43.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好极了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.08,0:20:47.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[SINGING] There once was a brave lad named Leonard
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.08,0:20:47.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}从前有个英勇少年 名字叫做莱纳德
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.00,0:20:51.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}With a fi-fi-fiddle dee-dee
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.00,0:20:51.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他的脸上有涂鸦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.29,0:20:54.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He faced a fearsome giant
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.29,0:20:54.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他面对可怕的巨人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.29,0:20:57.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}While Raj just wanted to pee
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.29,0:20:57.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拉吉却只想要嘘嘘
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.74,0:21:28.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}译者： 吴春燕
